WEBVTT

00:03:57.796 --> 00:04:03.396
and instead increase their holdings
in low carbon companies like, say,

00:04:03.396 --> 00:04:04.676
social media.

00:04:04.716 --> 00:04:05.836
(Laughs)

00:04:06.756 --> 00:04:11.276
But in one portfolio
that I help to oversee,

00:04:11.316 --> 00:04:13.676
one of the world's largest
cement producers

00:04:13.716 --> 00:04:15.916
is actually our top-emitting holding.

00:04:16.596 --> 00:04:20.196
But this company
has committed to achieving

00:04:20.236 --> 00:04:24.676
a zero-carbon production facility by 2030

00:04:24.716 --> 00:04:29.036
and net-zero firmwide by 2050.

00:04:29.956 --> 00:04:34.916
Now, I know some of you may be asking:
Is this company greenwashing?